# M18 "Kuşanma" (docs/PROTOCOL_EQUIPMENT.md §6), flow "m18_gear" (Ortaocak; run-ui-flows.ps1 with EnterLevel = 19 and
# EnterItems = 171 Sağlam Teber, 205 Ant Baltası, 279 / 283 Korlu Kaya / Meşe Yüzüğü, 284 Korlu Kıvılcım Küpesi,
# 287 Korlu Kurt Dişi Kolye, 290 Korlu Örme Kemer, 191 Korlu Savaş Çekici, 297 Ağanın Dalgalı Hançeri; at 1280x720,
# 1920x1080 and 1024x640 @150 %). A warrior relogs once (the raised level counts for item moves and stat points),
# opens the inventory: the extended equipment area (necklace, two rings, two earrings in a row, the belt in the
# right column) is empty; it wears the accessories and the halberd, the tooltips show the damage range, speed,
# reach, the bonus lines in their colour and an unmet requirement in red; the Ant Baltası is refused, the Künye
# shows attack power, Temel Vuruş, defence, speed, reach and the items' share; 13 Güç points later the Ant Baltası
# fits and the Künye follows.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m18_gear
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Kusanan
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+statsknown 1800
wait 30
key escape
waitfor world+menu 60
clickon world.menu.charselect
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+statsknown 1800
waitfor world+nobanner 400
scene expectbag 0 6
scene expectbag 1 171
scene expectbag 2 205
scene expectbag 3 279
scene expectbag 9 297
scene expectequipslot ring1 empty
scene camera front 9 3.2
key i
waitfor world+inv 30
wait 10
screenshot 01_inventory_empty_accessories.png
hoveron inv.equip.ring2
wait 5
expecttext inv.tooltip Yüzük
expecttext inv.tooltip Boş
hoveron inv.equip.belt
wait 5
expecttext inv.tooltip Kemer
screenshot 02_empty_belt_slot.png
# The accessories into their slots (a double click / right click would pick the first free ring / earring slot).
scene itemmove bag3 earring1
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
expecttext inv.message o yuvaya takılamaz
scene itemmove bag3 ring1
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
rclickon inv.bag.4
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
scene expectequipslot ring2 283
rclickon inv.bag.5
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
scene expectequipslot earring1 284
scene itemmove bag6 necklace
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
scene itemmove bag7 belt
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
scene itemmove bag1 main
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
scene expectequipslot ring1 279
scene expectequipslot necklace 287
scene expectequipslot belt 290
scene expectequipslot earring2 empty
scene expectequip main 171 off 0
wait 20
screenshot 03_inventory_accessories_worn.png
expecttext inv.summary Saldırı
expecttext inv.summary Hız 2,3 sn
hoveron inv.equip.main
wait 5
expecttext inv.tooltip Sağlam Teber
expecttext inv.tooltip Saldırı 13–19
expecttext inv.tooltip Hız: 2,3 sn (yavaş)
expecttext inv.tooltip Erim: 3,3 m
screenshot 04_tooltip_halberd.png
hoveron inv.equip.necklace
wait 5
expecttext inv.tooltip Korlu Kurt Dişi Kolye
expecttext inv.tooltip Takı · Kolye · Nadir
expecttext inv.tooltip Can +75
expecttext inv.tooltip Takılar yükseltilemez.
screenshot 05_tooltip_necklace.png
hoveron inv.equip.earring1
wait 5
expecttext inv.tooltip Kritik Vuruş +%1,5
screenshot 06_tooltip_earring.png
hoveron inv.bag.8
wait 5
expecttext inv.tooltip Korlu Savaş Çekici
expecttext inv.tooltip Hız: 2,4 sn (yavaş)
expecttext inv.tooltip Gerekli Güç: 22 (karşılanmıyor)
screenshot 07_tooltip_requirement_unmet.png
hoveron inv.bag.9
wait 5
expecttext inv.tooltip Ağanın Dalgalı Hançeri
expecttext inv.tooltip Hız: 1,2 sn (hızlı)
expecttext inv.tooltip (karşılanmıyor)
screenshot 08_tooltip_unique_dagger.png
# The Ant Baltası needs Güç 25: refused with the M11 message.
scene itemmove bag2 main
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
expecttext inv.message niteliklerin yetersiz
scene expectequip main 171 off 0
hoveron inv.bag.2
wait 5
expecttext inv.tooltip Gerekli Güç: 25 (karşılanmıyor)
screenshot 09_requirement_refused.png
# The Künye with the halberd: attack power, Temel Vuruş (range x the speed factor), speed, reach, the items' share.
key c
waitfor world+kunye 60
wait 5
expecttext kunye.derived Saldırı Hızı 2,3 sn
expecttext kunye.derived Erim 3,3 m
expecttext kunye.derived Temel Vuruş
expecttext kunye.derived (+125)
scene expectderived speed 2.3
scene expectderived reach 3.3
screenshot 10_kunye_halberd.png
scene statadd guc 13
waitfor world+pending 30
clickon kunye.confirm
waitfor world+modal 60
clickon messagebox.button0
waitfor world+allocated1+statidle+nopending 600
scene expectattr guc 25 5
key c
waitfor world+kunyeclosed 60
# (on a small screen the Künye pushed the inventory away)
scene inventory open
waitfor world+inv 30
scene itemmove bag2 main
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
scene expectequip main 205 off 0
hoveron inv.equip.main
wait 5
expecttext inv.tooltip Ant Baltası
expecttext inv.tooltip Gerekli Güç: 25
screenshot 11_ant_axe_requirement_met.png
key c
waitfor world+kunye 60
wait 5
scene expectderived speed 2.2
scene expectderived reach 2.7
expecttext kunye.derived (+145)
screenshot 12_kunye_ant_axe.png
scene statlog
quit
